# mock-tfconfig-fail.sentinel
# NON-COMPLIANT config:
#   - AWS provider uses a range (~> 6.0) instead of the approved exact version
#   - an extra provider from an unknown namespace
#   - a module straight from a random GitHub repo with no version
#   - a registry module that is not on the approved list and uses a range

